# Docker-specific ignore for the repository-root context used by
# `docker build -f workers/ifood/Dockerfile .`.
#
# The stale Task 4 plan named `workers/ifood/.dockerignore`; Docker only applies
# a per-Dockerfile ignore when it is adjacent to the Dockerfile and named
# `Dockerfile.dockerignore`, so this file is the intentional deviation.
**
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!workers/
!workers/ifood/
!workers/ifood/**
!src/
!src/lib/
!src/lib/server/
!src/lib/server/ifood/
!src/lib/server/ifood/**
